===Origin===
*This card's illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Ancient Origins|Sableye|44}} from the {{TCG|Ancient Origins}} expansion.
*'''Dirty Throw''' is an attack that first appeared on {{TCG ID|Cosmic Eclipse|Absol|133}} from the {{TCG|Cosmic Eclipse}} expansion.
